+ * The vendor drives brightness over DCS (qcom,mdss-dsi-bl-pmic-control-type =
+ * "bl_ctrl_dcs") with a single parameter byte, so use mipi_dsi_dcs_write()
+ * rather than mipi_dsi_dcs_set_display_brightness(), which sends the two-byte
+ * form this panel does not expect. Identical to stock's led_pwm1 packet.
+ *
