+ * the DSP session start, and the capture is silence.
+ *
+ * Payload is the vendor's (slim-msm-ngd.c ngd_remove_ch): a control byte of
+ * SLIM_CH_REMOVE in the top two bits plus the low five bits of the client's
+ * logical address, a transaction id, then one byte per channel; then a
+ * RECONFIG_NOW to make it take effect.
